            value: "goal,,,0,500,%7B%22id%22%3A%5B%22Tallin%22%5D%7D;goal,,,0,500,%7B%22id%22%3A%5B%22Tallin%22%5D%7D;goal,,,0,500,%7B%22id%22%3A%5B%22Tallin%22%5D%7D;goal,,,0,500,%7B%22id%22%3A%5B%22Tallin%22%5D%7D",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_28",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Puzzled by the presence of trolls so close to the dwarvish defenses, the party quickly made their way back to Knalga."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_29",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Upon arriving there something seemed to be wrong. Instead of being boisterously hailed by the dwarves as before, they were met by silent guards with downcast eyes."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_30",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Fearing the worst, Tallin rushed to find Hamel."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_31",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Hamel, what is wrong?! Why is everyone acting so strangely?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_32",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ We are deeply ashamed of ourselves, Tallin. We ha’ failed the trust that ye gave us."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_33",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ What do you mean?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_34",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Yer gold, Tallin, we failed to protect it."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_35",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My gold!? Why, what happened? Start from the beginning."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_36",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ No sooner had ye left then the orcs once again launched a massive assault."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_37",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Such a massive and fierce assault it was that we had to call upon all our reserves. When that proved insufficient, we had nae other choice then to call some dwarves off the other defenses."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_38",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ It was a ploy. Nae sooner than we ha’ thinned the ranks of the northern defenders, a small force of trolls smashed through the defenses and made their way straight for your gold."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_39",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ We beat them back, but not before they made off with your entire stock of gold."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_40",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I am sorry, Tallin, we did all that we could. I would we could ha’ done more."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_41",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Oh no! Rakshas will raise many troops with that gold!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_42",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Aye. Well I ken it, Tallin."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_43",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Eryssa.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ See, you wretched human! At least now you will appreciate the generosity of the elves."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_44",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Arthian.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Shut up, you little snot! If it wasn’t for you we wouldn’t have lost our gold in the first place!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_45",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Eryssa.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I wasn’t talking to you, lich! Learn to keep your mouth shut."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_46",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Who is this annoying chit?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_47",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ This is the famous and benevolent Princess Eryssa, in whose rescue we sacrificed many lives and <i>much</i> gold."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_48",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Eryssa.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ That’s it! I have had enough from you worthless rabble. I will soon send a rider with the promised gold, and in the meantime, I’m leaving!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_49",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Arthian.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Begone and good riddance, brat!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_50",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Back to the issue of the stolen gold, were you able to pursue the trolls?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_51",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Were you able to pursue them?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_52",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ This isn’t looking good. Not only do we fail to get the Princess but now we lost all of our gold! Seriously Hamel, I don’t know if we’re gonna make it."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_53",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Don’t give in to despair, Tallin. At least you prevented the orcs from getting the ransom money."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_54",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Yeah, they ran off with all the rest of our gold instead."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_55",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Snap out of it Tallin! We are not in control of fate. We will do all we can to the best of our ability and leave the results to the gods."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_56",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22or%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22eryssa_hostile%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ You’re right, Hamel, sorry. Were you able to pursue the trolls?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_57",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Och, we tried, Tallin, but with the orcs still pressing our southern defenses and trolls trying to break through everywhere, we simply ha’ not the power."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_58",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ How long ago did the trolls make off with the gold?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_59",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ It couldna’ ha’ been more than a day now."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_60",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Then we shall pursue them. Even if we don’t catch them then we might be able to hit Rakshas before he has had a chance to put that gold to good use."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_61",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Hamel, rally the dwarves and prepare to make an all-out offensive against the orcs. It’s time to give them some of their own."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_62",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ We will follow the trail of the trolls; it should lead us back to Rakshas."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_63",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Eryssa, what news of the elves?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_64",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Eryssa.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Our gryphons have reached them. They are no more than a few days march from us."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_65",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Eryssa.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I will send another message to them asking them to send out scouts to locate the trolls who took your gold. Mayhap the elves will be able to get between the trolls and their allies."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_66",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "eryssa_hostile",
            not_equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ It is well thought. May the Bright Gods be with you."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_67",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So it shall be. Hamel, when I make contact with the orcs I’ll send you a message. When you get it, come at all speed. It is near time for the battle that will decide all."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_68",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The axes and hammers o’ every dwarf thirst for the blood of the orcs!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_69",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ All right, let’s move out, people!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_70",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Thus the party set off to the northern tunnels to pursue the trolls."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_71",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("They met but light resistance all along the trail of the trolls, which they quickly overcame."),
          },
        ],
      },
