          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Yeah, man! I knew we could count on you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Hmmm, he must have smelled the scent of other drakes and gone to them to convince them to help us."),
